<!--
  Hinglish (hi-Latn): Hindi in Latin script, the way people type it in chats -
  NOT a respelling of values-hi. Keep English for UI and technical nouns
  (video, settings, theme, update, version); use Hindi for grammar and
  connective words. Polite aap-register throughout ("use karein", never
  "use kar"). Fixed spellings: hai, nahi, kiya, gaya, karein, ke liye, abhi,
  jaldi, aap, apne, yahan, dikhenge, chahiye, me (not "mein"). No Devanagari characters
  anywhere in this directory (StringKeyParityTest checks).
-->
